"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment.\n"}]}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn9le02ob06re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn9le02ob06re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn9le02ob06re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn9le02ob06re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "Several years ago, Jessica Bloom, editor of the school newspaper, decided to do something useful with the large number of pens that were being thrown out every day. Our environment is being affected by junked plastic items, like pens. Instead of discarding her old pens, Jessica began collecting her pens, along with those of other students in her class."}, {"time": "24000", "image": "engenn9le02ob06re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "Within a short time, Jessica amassed a pen collection that filled up her drawers at home. At first, Jessica was unsure what to do with these discarded items, but then one day when one of her books fell off her shelf, an idea hit her. She took her collection to the local plastic factory and asked them to melt down her pens.<br/>\nWith her soft plastic, Jessica started to design plastic bookends of all different sizes and shapes. Her classmates loved the idea of a creative way to hold their books on a desk or shelf, and started buying the bookends."}, {"time": "65500", "image": "engenn9le02ob06re2img03.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "Recently, her idea has been taken over by a private design company. They have begun using the plastic form recycled pens in many of their products. The plastic is being repurposed and the company is helping to save the environment.<br/>\nThe recycled plastic is economical and environmentally-friendly. For Jessica and her classmates, this idea has become a method to write their way to a better environment."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}]}